        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vendor deploy &amp; brief shoppers on the scenario script, evidence-capture protocol (W4367), conduct code (W4365), and submit timeline
Responsible (R): Vendor / Service Quality
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality
Duration: Per visit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4369_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4369_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
