        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Service Quality/Ecommerce design the omnichannel test scenarios — site/app search, product-content accuracy, checkout, BOPIS pickup (VS-10), delivery (VS-143), marketplace (VS-65), digital support
Responsible (R): Service Quality / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality / Ecommerce Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
