Responsible (R): Shopper / Tester
Accountable (A): Service Quality Lead
Duration: Per test</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4371_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4371_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4371_Task7" name="Service Quality score the omnichannel service vs rubric (W4362), validate…">
