    <bpmn:process id="W_W4376" name="W4376. Findings Triage, Severity Classification &amp; Escalation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Validated finding (W4375)
Frequency: Per finding + batch
Volume: All service findings
Owner: Service Quality / CX (VS-13) / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: Service Quality, CX (VS-13), Store Ops (VS-07), HR (VS-103), Ethics (VS-119), Leadership
Source: workflow W4376 — Findings Triage, Severity Classification &amp; Escalation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4376_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4376_Lane1" name="Service Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4376_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4376_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4376_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4376_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4376_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4376_Start3" name="Validated finding (W4375)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4376_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4376_Task4" name="Service Quality triage each finding — severity (critical/major/minor), type…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Service Quality triage each finding — severity (critical/major/minor), type (behavior, knowledge, process, recovery, compliance), and the responsible unit/store/associate
Responsible (R): Service Quality
Accountable (A): Service Quality Lead
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4376_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4376_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4376_Task5" name="Service Quality escalate critical/major findings (safety, legal, ethics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Service Quality escalate critical/major findings (safety, legal, ethics, repeat-critical) to the right owner (Store Ops/HR/Ethics/Leadership) per governance (W4365)
Responsible (R): Service Quality
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4376_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4376_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4376_Task6" name="Service Quality route all findings to feedback/remediation (W4377) and track to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Service Quality route all findings to feedback/remediation (W4377) and track to closure, with dispute/appeal path (W4380)
Responsible (R): Service Quality / CX / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4376_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4376_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4376_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4376_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-669 (ensure controlled execution — Mystery Shopping, Service Audit &amp; Measurement Operations (PA-146.2).) | - CTL-669: findings tried by severity; critical escalated per governance (W4365); closure tracked; dispute path available (W4380)
Owner: Service Quality / CX (VS-13) / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
